WEBVTT

00:02:59.292 --> 00:03:03.226
that is supposed to be
truly and entirely our own:

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.625
our bodies.

00:03:05.542 --> 00:03:10.500
I've been haunted by one thought
since my experience first began.

00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:14.268
As I tried to make sense
of what happened to me,

00:03:14.292 --> 00:03:15.917
I thought to myself:

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:18.833
this is all my fault.

00:03:20.083 --> 00:03:23.167
I didn't say "no" good enough.

00:03:24.792 --> 00:03:28.042
Next time, I'll say "no" better.

00:03:29.458 --> 00:03:32.101
I've questioned why
that was my go-to response